  {
   "id": "bullet-beat-129915@major-2020-12-08",
   "gameId": "bullet-beat-129915",
   "displayName": "Taimumari five-year anniversary and update to Definitive Edition",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-12-08T18:30:27.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "On December 16, 2015 I released my first commercial game - Taimumari. It was not a perfect and polished game, but it was my dream. With Taimumari I was able to leave my office work and realize my projects.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And today, five years later, the game gets a major upgrade, straight from the consoles. I hope you will be pleased with the new graphics in the dialogues. If you wish, you can also play the classic version. https://store.steampowered.com/app/375520",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The new Definitive Edition also includes an addition with Kanashimi, which now does not need to be purchased separately.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I am also developing Taimumari 2 and unfortunately I was not able to release it by the fifth anniversary as planned. There's still a lot of work to do, so I don't know when I can release it yet. https://store.steampowered.com/app/1292400",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "However, my small BakuMari project will be released soon - you can check out its Steam page now. https://store.steampowered.com/app/1470880/BakuMari",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I appreciate your support and hope that you will also play my future games. Thank you all!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
